    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d32-a1">

                <pb facs="0054" n="47" sameAs="frus:frus1894Nicaragua/pg47"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure in No. 32.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Rivas to Mr.
                            Baker.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>
                            <placeName type="venue"><hi rendition="#small-caps">National
                                Palace</hi></placeName>, <lb/>
                            <placeName type="city"><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Managua</hi></placeName></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-04-02"><hi rendition="#italic">April 2,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Minister</hi>: With the present communication I
                    have the honor to remit to Tour Excellency an authorized copy of the telegram
                    directed to His Excellency the President, by the commissioner of the Mosquito
                    Reserve, euunciating the basis stipulated with the English consul for the
                    provisional administration of the said reserve.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">R. Mayorga Rivas.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
